```

**Multi-session detail**: `Sessions` array has one entry per session (0-based indexing), each containing:
```go
type SessionFilePaths struct {
    Metadata    string  // "/a1/b2c3d4e5f6/0/metadata.json" (with leading slash)
    Transcript  string  // "/a1/b2c3d4e5f6/0/full.jsonl"
    ContentHash string  // "/a1/b2c3d4e5f6/0/content_hash.txt"
